# Expected application graph for the graph conformance fixture (ontology.md at the repository root).
# The workspace in ./workspace projects to exactly these triples, in the
# workspace's named graph urn:clearhead:workspace:01a0fb10-0000-7000-8000-000000000000,
# with the viewer's zone UTC. Paths are relative to the data root (.clearhead/).

